[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0264","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0264.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-35361","title":"uutils coreutils mknod 命令 SELinux 安全上下文标签漏洞","description":"uutils coreutils 中的 mknod 命令存在 SELinux 上下文设置缺陷：在创建设备节点后才设置 SELinux 上下文（而非 GNU 实现在创建前通过 setfscreatecon 原子化标记），当设置 SELinux 上下文失败时，清理函数错误地使用 remove_dir 删除设备节点或 FIFO 文件（实际无法删除），导致标记错误的节点残留。在 SELinux 强制模式下，攻击者可利用此缺陷创建上下文错误的设备节点，绕过强制访问控制策略，造成权限提升或系统安全策略规避。该漏洞影响 uutils coreutils 相关版本。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-35361","GHSA-r9hw-mj3w-phcq"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-04-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-04-23T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 uutils coreutils 至 0.6.0 或更高版本，该版本已合入修复 PR #10582，在 mknod 前通过 setfscreatecon 原子化设置 SELinux 上下文。如无法立即升级，可通过 SELinux 策略限制 mknod 命令的执行权限，或避免在 SELinux enforcing 模式下使用 mknod 创建设备节点作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35361.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-35361.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/cargo/uu_mknod/CVE-2026-35361.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-35361","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35361.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-35361.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-35361.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-r9hw-mj3w-phcq/GHSA-r9hw-mj3w-phcq.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-35361.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/c90ad5c96a79db358ddf823df4ed4f299d202d94/data/osv-cargo.purl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0264.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0265","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0265.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-35381","title":"The user wants me to generate a [title] field for CVE-2026-35381. Let me analyze the information: - Vendor: uutils (or possibly GNU coreutils, but specifically uutils coreutils) - Product: coreutils (specifically the `cut` utility) - Vulnerability type: 逻辑错误 (logic error) - specifically parameter handling flaw The title format is: \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" From the NVD description and other info: - Product: uutils coreutils cut tool - Vulnerability: A logic error where `-s` flag is ignored when combined with `-z -d ''` options, causing undelimited records to be emitted instead of suppressed. So the title should be something like: \"uutils coreutils cut 工具参数顺序错误漏洞\" or \"uutils coreutils cut 逻辑错误漏洞\" Looking at the Chinese description from AVD: \"uutils coreutils cut工具参数顺序错误漏洞(CVE-2026-35381)\" - this gives us a good hint. The title format is \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\": - 厂商: uutils - 产品: coreutils cut 工具 - 漏洞类型: 逻辑错误漏洞 or 参数处理逻辑错误漏洞 Let me craft a concise title following the \"厂商","description":"uutils coreutils 的 cut 工具在处理 `-z`（空终止符）与 `-d ''`（空分隔符）组合参数时存在逻辑错误，导致 `-s`（仅输出包含分隔符的行）标志被忽略。该漏洞源于程序将特定参数组合错误路由至换行符分隔的专用代码路径，未检查记录抑制状态，从而输出本应过滤的完整未分隔记录及 NUL 字节。此行为与 GNU coreutils 存在差异，影响依赖 `cut -s` 过滤未分隔数据的自动化管道，造成数据完整性风险。CVSS 评分 3.3，危害等级低，攻击者需本地触发。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-35381","GHSA-pmfc-4wjj-gmhx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-04-22T17:16:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:40:29Z","remediation":"升级 uutils coreutils 至包含此修复的版本（关注 GitHub uutils/coreutils 仓库的发布说明，该漏洞由 Zellic 通过 coreutils-private PR #102 报告）。如暂时无法升级，可将依赖 cut 的脚本中的 `cut -z -d '' -s -f N` 替换为 GNU coreutils 版本的 cut（安装 GNU coreutils 包并使用 `gcut` 命令），或改用 awk/sed 等工具实现相同的分隔过滤逻辑，例如 `awk -v RS='' -F'' '{if(NF>=N) print $N}'` 来替代 cut -s 的行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/uutils/coreutils/pull/11394","https://github.com/uutils/coreutils/releases/tag/0.8.0","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35381.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-35381.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/cargo/uu_cut/CVE-2026-35381.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-35381","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35381.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-35381.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-35381.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-pmfc-4wjj-gmhx/GHSA-pmfc-4wjj-gmhx.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-35381.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/c90ad5c96a79db358ddf823df4ed4f299d202d94/data/osv-cargo.purl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0265.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0263","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0263.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-35341","title":"uutils coreutils mkfifo 现成文件权限修改漏洞","description":"uutils coreutils 的 mkfifo 命令存在权限绕过漏洞。当 mkfifo() 因目标路径已存在文件而创建失败时，代码仅输出错误信息但缺少 `continue;` 语句，导致执行流程意外进入后续的 `set_permissions` 调用，将已存在文件的权限修改为默认 FIFO 模式（0o666 & umask → 0644）。攻击者可通过预创建目标文件并诱导受害者执行 mkfifo 命令，将敏感文件（如 SSH 私钥）权限修改为全局可读，造成信息泄露。该漏洞影响 uutils coreutils 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-35341","GHSA-pmf6-rcx4-v53v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-04-22T17:16:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:40:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 uutils coreutils 至包含 commit `00f77cc`（2026-01-23）或更新版本，该提交在 mkfifo 创建失败时添加了缺失的 `continue;` 语句，阻止后续 `set_permissions` 执行。如无法升级，可考虑在系统层面使用 GNU coreutils 替代 uutils coreutils 的 mkfifo，或通过文件系统监控（如 fanotify）检测对敏感文件的意外权限变更作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/uutils/coreutils/issues/10020","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35341.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-35341.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/cargo/uu_mkfifo/CVE-2026-35341.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-35341","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35341.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-35341.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-35341.md","https://github.com/Floodnut/xfx/blob/16f0ea0c869438adbe22af0a20922e9494c66ff7/vulnerability/opensource/CVE-2026-35341-uutils-mkfifo-missing-continue.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/dc4ab29758552fce2b71b92dc68fc56ce91f64eb/posts/cve-2026-35341-rust-uu-mkfifo.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-pmf6-rcx4-v53v/GHSA-pmf6-rcx4-v53v.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0263.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0088","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-31431","title":"Linux Kernel algif_aead 堆溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 crypto 子系统的 algif_aead 接口存在堆内存溢出漏洞，由于在 AEAD 加密操作中错误地采用了原地（in-place）处理模式，而源和目标缓冲区来自不同的内存映射区域，导致堆内存越界写入。本地攻击者可通过 AF_ALG 套接字接口发送特制的 AEAD 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可实现权限提升（LPE）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.12.10 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-31431"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-04-22T09:16:21Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:19:47Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.10 或更高版本（对应发行版请安装最新稳定版内核包）。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 AF_ALG 套接字家族（modprobe.blacklist=algif_aead）或限制非特权用户访问 crypto 接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/19d43105a97be0810edbda875f2cd03f30dc130c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3115af9644c342b356f3f07a4dd1c8905cd9a6fc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/893d22e0135fa394db81df88697fba6032747667","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8b88d99341f139e23bdeb1027a2a3ae10d341d82","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/961cfa271a918ad4ae452420e7c303149002875b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a664bf3d603dc3bdcf9ae47cc21e0daec706d7a5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ce42ee423e58dffa5ec03524054c9d8bfd4f6237","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fafe0fa2995a0f7073c1c358d7d3145bcc9aedd8","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/29/23","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/29/25","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/29/26","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/30/10","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/30/11","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/30/12"