urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0968","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0968.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-35230","title":"Oracle VM VirtualBox Core 组件权限提升漏洞","description":"Oracle VM VirtualBox 7.2.6 的 Core 组件存在访问控制缺陷（CWE-284），具有高权限的本地攻击者通过登录 VirtualBox 宿主机环境可利用该漏洞，成功利用后可完全接管 VirtualBox 虚拟机管理程序，实现虚拟机逃逸。由于攻击影响范围可跨越至其他产品（Scope Change），成功利用后对机密性、完整性和可用性均造成高危害。该漏洞利用难度较高，需攻击者已具备本地高权限，Oracle 已在 2026 年 4 月关键补丁更新中修复该问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-35230"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-21T21:16:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:40:14Z","remediation":"立即安装 Oracle 2026 年 4 月关键补丁更新（Critical Patch Update - April 2026）中针对 Oracle VM VirtualBox 的补丁，升级至包含该修复的 VirtualBox 最新版本。补丁可从 My Oracle Support 获取，对应安全公告为 https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2026.html。由于该漏洞需要本地高权限登录才能利用，在无法立即打补丁的情况下，应严格限制对 VirtualBox 宿主机的本地访问权限，仅允许受信任的管理员用户登录，并审计高权限用户列表。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2026.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5197f6d88a4fb8976a538beb60d39dd5ad36efed/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-352xx/CVE-2026-35230.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-35230.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0968.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0964","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0964.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-3518","title":"Progress LoadMaster 操作系统命令注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Progress ADC 系列产品（包括 LoadMaster、ECS 连接管理器、对象规模连接管理器和 MOVEit WAF）的 API 中存在操作系统命令注入远程代码执行漏洞。具有 \"All\" 权限的认证攻击者可通过向 'killsession' 命令提交未经正确清理的输入，在 LoadMaster 设备上以系统权限执行任意命令。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分的过滤和转义，导致攻击者能够注入恶意操作系统命令。攻击者需已获得高权限认证且位于相邻网络，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-3518"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-20T14:16:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:43:42Z","remediation":"立即将 LoadMaster 升级至 V7.2.63.1（GA 版本）或 V7.2.54.17（LTSF 版本），ECS Connections Manager、Object Scale Connection Manager 及 MOVEit WAF 同步升级至 V7.2.63.1。补丁下载地址：https://community.progress.com/s/article/LoadMaster-Security-Vulnerabilites-CVE-2026-3517-CVE-2026-3518-CVE-2026-3519-CVE-2026-4048-CVE-2026-21876。如无法立即升级，可在管理界面限制具备 \"All\" 权限的账户数量，并严格审计 killsession 命令的调用日志，监控异常命令执行行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://community.progress.com/s/article/LoadMaster-Security-Vulnerabilites-CVE-2026-3517-CVE-2026-3518-CVE-2026-3519-CVE-2026-4048-CVE-2026-21876","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3518.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3518.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-3518.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-3518.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-3518.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-3518.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-35xx/CVE-2026-3518.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/e2128a6dc0e98f76e7ba5d8421c64ce7b4a1d548/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-3518/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2026/CVE-2026-3518.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-3518.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0964.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0962","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0962.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-3517","title":"Progress ADC Products 操作系统命令注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Progress ADC 系列产品（包括 LoadMaster、ECS 连接管理器、Object Scale 连接管理器及 MOVEit WAF）的 API 接口中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞。具有\"Geo Administration\"权限的认证攻击者可通过向 'addcountry' 命令提交特制的恶意输入，利用程序对用户输入未进行充分过滤的缺陷，在 LoadMaster 设备上执行任意系统命令，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高，攻击者需具备认证权限且位于相邻网络，但成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-3517"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-20T14:16:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:43:42Z","remediation":"立即将 Progress LoadMaster 升级至 7.2.63.1 或更高版本（LTSF 分支升级至 7.2.54.17），ECS Connection Manager、Object Scale Connection Manager 及 MOVEit WAF 同步升级至 7.2.63.1。如无法立即升级，在管理界面中严格限制 Geo Administration 角色的用户数量，并审计所有 addcountry 命令的调用日志，同时通过防火墙限制对 LoadMaster 管理 API 的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://community.progress.com/s/article/LoadMaster-Security-Vulnerabilites-CVE-2026-3517-CVE-2026-3518-CVE-2026-3519-CVE-2026-4048-CVE-2026-21876","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3517.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3517.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-3517.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-3517.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-3517.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-3517.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-35xx/CVE-2026-3517.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/e2128a6dc0e98f76e7ba5d8421c64ce7b4a1d548/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-3517/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2026/CVE-2026-3517.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-3517.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0962.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1095","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-4682","title":"HP DeskJet 一体机 WSD 扫描远程代码执行漏洞","description":"部分 HP DeskJet 系列一体机打印机存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-121）。当设备处理通过 WSD（Web Services for Devices）协议接收的特制扫描请求时，由于对输入数据的边界检查不足，攻击者可在缓冲区中写入超出预期长度的数据并覆盖相邻内存区域，从而在打印机固件上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响支持 WSD 扫描功能的 HP DeskJet All in One 设备，攻击者无需身份认证即可在局域网内发送恶意构造的 WSD 扫描请求触发漏洞，实现远程代码执行并完全控制目标设备。由于 WSD 协议允许用户在无需安装专用驱动程序的情况下直接向网络扫描仪发送扫描任务，此类设备通常部署在企业办公网络环境中，攻击者可利用该漏洞作为内网横向移动的跳板，进而访问敏感打印数据或进一步渗透内网系统。CVSS 评分为 8.7，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-4682"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-15T15:16:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:57:01Z","remediation":"立即将受影响设备升级至固件版本 2612A 或更高版本（受影响型号包括 HP DeskJet 2800e/4200/4200e/Ink Advantage 2800/4200/Ultra 4900 全系列一体机），可通过 HP 官方支持页面 https://support.hp.com/us-en/document/ish_14744451-14744475-16/hpsbpi04110 下载对应固件并按照说明安装。如暂时无法升级，应在防火墙或网络层面阻断不必要的 WSD（Web Services for Devices）扫描流量，限制来自不可信主机的 TCP 端口 5357（WSD 端口）访问，以降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.hp.com/us-en/document/ish_14744451-14744475-16","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2026/4xxx/CVE-2026-4682.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/4xxx/CVE-2026-4682.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-4682.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-4682.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-4682.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-4682.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-46xx/CVE-2026-4682.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/2b69dd63395ad7510b86e8c698c785b0ea31ab61/content/posts/cve-2026-4682.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2026/CVE-2026-4682.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-4682.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0991","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0991.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-40688","title":"Fortinet FortiWeb 越界写入漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiWeb 存在越界写入漏洞（CWE-787），受影响版本包括 FortiWeb 8.0.0 至 8.0.3、7.6.0 至 7.6.6 以及 7.4.0 至 7.4.11。具有高权限的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用后可实现任意代码或命令执行，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，建议用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-40688"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-14T23:16:29Z","updated":"2026-07-24T21:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 FortiWeb 升级至修复版本：8.0.x 升级至 8.0.4 及以上、7.6.x 升级至 7.6.7 及以上、7.4.x 升级至 7.4.12 及以上。如无法立即升级，应严格限制管理接口仅对可信 IP 开放，并启用多因素认证以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.fortinet.com/psirt/FG-IR-26-127","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2026/40xxx/CVE-2026-40688.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/20c018f1a1b9bca1242ee2249074773858b2a0ac/2026/40xxx/CVE-2026-40688.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-40688.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-40688.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-40688.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-40688.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-406xx/CVE-2026-40688.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b4c640370a6a34ea36c82cbaea3c29d7c103902a/content/posts/cve-2026-40688.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-40688","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-40688"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0991.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0953","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0953.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34619","title":"Adobe ColdFusion 路径遍历漏洞","description":"标签中输出这个描述。<value>Adobe ColdFusion 存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），由于对文件路径的限制不完善，低权限远程攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列的恶意请求，绕过安全限制访问受限目录之外的敏感文件或目录。该漏洞影响 ColdFusion 2023.18、2025.6 及更早版本，攻击无需用户交互且攻击复杂度低。成功利用可导致安全特性被绕过，造成未授权访问或信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34619"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-14T22:16:31Z","updated":"2026-07-24T22:10:00Z","remediation":"ColdFusion 2025 用户应升级至 Update 7，ColdFusion 2023 用户应升级至 Update 19。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 ColdFusion 管理界面和内部路径的访问，或临时禁用不必要的目录映射作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/coldfusion/apsb26-38.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34619.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a80088c333d18acfc433e05d369205d159a29769/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34619.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34619.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34619.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34619.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-34619.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/e2128a6dc0e98f76e7ba5d8421c64ce7b4a1d548/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-34619/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-34619.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-346xx/CVE-2026-34619.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-34619"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0953.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0541","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0541.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27305","title":"Adobe ColdFusion 路径遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Adobe ColdFusion 2023.18、2025.6 及更早版本存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需用户交互即可利用该漏洞，通过构造特制的路径参数绕过目录限制，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、密码文件等），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，影响范围广，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27305"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-14T22:16:29Z","updated":"2026-07-25T11:10:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe ColdFusion 至 2023 Update 19 或 2025 Update 7 及以上版本，可通过 ColdFusion 管理后台的 Administrator > System Information > Updates 检查并安装最新安全更新。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层配置规则，限制对 `..`、`%2e%2e` 等路径遍历特征的 URL 请求，并禁用不必要的文件访问接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/coldfusion/apsb26-38.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27305.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27305.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-27305/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-27305.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-27305","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/