arencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-27282.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-rfcg-4cq5-pfmm/GHSA-rfcg-4cq5-pfmm.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2026-27282","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27282.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-04-15_zh.md","https://github.com/RogoLabs/CNAScoreCard/blob/f55dfa87aa769a456b7e2f07b366061b62759da0/web/data/cna/adobe.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0539.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0557","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-33104","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32K GRFX 本地提权漏洞","description":"Windows Win32K 图形内核子系统（GRFX）中存在竞争条件漏洞（CWE-362），由于对共享资源的并发访问缺乏正确的同步机制，导致权限提升。已获得本地系统访问权限的攻击者可利用此漏洞，在目标系统上以提升后的权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制系统。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，攻击复杂度较高，需要攻击者已具备低权限账户并经过身份认证。Microsoft 尚未发布官方安全更新。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-33104"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-14T18:17:33Z","updated":"2026-07-24T23:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2026 年 4 月安全更新（对应 Windows 2026-Apr 月度累积更新），通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。该漏洞影响 Windows Win32K-GRFX 组件，攻击者需本地登录并利用条件竞争释放后使用（UAF）缺陷提权至 SYSTEM。如无法立即打补丁，可限制低权限用户本地登录、启用 Windows Defender 攻击面减少（ASR）规则阻止可疑提权行为作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33104","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33104.json","https://github.com/ghostbyt3/nday-automation-ai/blob/7d9092a9e38adbc14ad3f92d17941172b09dbb67/nday_research_reports/2026-Apr/CVE-2026-33104_win32kbase.sys_analysis.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51922162e2cbb5914a11ad939c724b426142677c/content/posts/cve-2026-33104.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-33104","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33104.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-33104.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-2jq3-gg4w-j24c/GHSA-2jq3-gg4w-j24c.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2026-33104","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-33104.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-04-15_zh.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0557.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0692","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0692.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-32203","title":"Microsoft .NET System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET Framework 及 Visual Studio 中的 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 组件存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-121），该漏洞源于 EncryptedXml 类对输入数据缺乏充分的边界检查与验证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造特制的 XML 数据包发送至目标系统，利用缓冲区溢出触发拒绝服务（DoS）攻击，导致应用程序崩溃或无法正常处理加密请求。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 .NET 8（≤8.0.2）、.NET 9（≤9.0.14）及 .NET 10（≤10.0.5）的项目，攻击条件宽松且无需身份认证。Microsoft 已于 2026 年 4 月发布安全公告，建议将 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包升级至修复版本（.NET 8 升级至 8.0.3、.NET 9 升级至 9.0.15、.NET 10 升级至 10.0.6）以消除漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-32203","GHSA